# Build-context excludes for the container image build (podman reads this;
# Docker reads the identical .dockerignore). Keeping node_modules and build
# artifacts OUT of the context is both correctness (the builder runs `npm ci`
# for the image's own platform — host node_modules is the wrong arch) and a
# hard requirement on the memory-constrained local VM (copying node_modules
# blows the build context and OOMs the transfer).
node_modules
.next
.git
.gitignore
npm-debug.log*
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.containerignore
.env
.env.*
README.md
